{
  "duration": 42.0,
  "wave_silence_start": 24.3,
  "wave_silence_duration": 2.0,
  "tail_start": 39.0,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "Vivian",
      "text": "昨晚谁说，五点出发，不起的是狗？",
      "start": 0.18,
      "end": 3.45
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "Ryan",
      "text": "汪。你先去，我看你朋友圈。",
      "start": 3.65,
      "end": 7.48
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "Vivian",
      "text": "攻略你做的，闹钟你定的，你倒是起啊！",
      "start": 7.68,
      "end": 11.16
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "Ryan",
      "text": "昨晚做攻略的时候，没想到今天真得起。",
      "start": 11.31,
      "end": 16.61
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "Vivian",
      "text": "快点，太阳都露头了！",
      "start": 16.76,
      "end": 18.55
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "Ryan",
      "text": "请假躲过了早会，没躲过早起。",
      "start": 18.7,
      "end": 24.1
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "Vivian",
      "text": "还困吗？",
      "start": 26.3,
      "end": 27.26
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "Ryan",
      "text": "往旁边站一点。",
      "start": 27.41,
      "end": 30.13
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "Vivian",
      "text": "干嘛？",
      "start": 30.33,
      "end": 30.81
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "Ryan",
      "text": "挡我拍照了。",
      "start": 31.01,
      "end": 32.31
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "speaker": "Vivian",
      "text": "刚才谁说看朋友圈就行？",
      "start": 32.46,
      "end": 34.73
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "speaker": "Ryan",
      "text": "改主意了。今天让别人看我的。",
      "start": 34.93,
      "end": 38.85
    }
  ]
}